# `Music assets`

Canonical background music for Mini-Kuzai YouTube videos is stored in this directory.

Preferred filename:

`kuzai-dark-cyberpunk-background-60s.wav`

Fallback if only MP3 is available:

`kuzai-dark-cyberpunk-background-60s.mp3`

Requirements:
- duration suitable for the fixed 60-second video timeline
- instrumental only
- no drums or percussion
- dark cyberpunk / industrial ambient identity
- heavy bass pads, sub-bass drones and electrical / machine textures
- mixed below Piper narration
- YouTube-compatible usage rights
- source/license documented

